Sat Oct 31 09:37:31 UTC 2026 - Tomáš Chvátal <tomas.chvatal@gmail.com>

- Set Version to 20261031.
- Drop the five hyprland_extra plugin Recommends that are not packaged in
  Factory (hyprland-plugin-hyprexpo, hyprland-plugin-hyprscrolling, hyprland-
  plugin-hyprtrails, hyprland-plugin-hyprwinwrap, hyprland-plugin-xtra-
  dispatchers); hyprland-plugins only builds four plugins.
- Drop the hyprland-branding-openSUSE Recommends: no such package in Factory.
- Replace swaybar with waybar as the main pattern bar (swaybar needs Sway IPC
  for workspaces; waybar is the Hyprland-native bar).
- Add hyprlock, hypridle and hyprpolkitagent Recommends: Hyprland-native lock,
  idle and authentication agent for a complete session; add wl-clipboard
  Recommends to helper utilities.
- Drop the now-redundant waybar Recommends from hyprland_extra (the main pattern
  recommends it).
- Drop the dead Supplements line from hyprland_extra: it supplemented (hyprland
  and hyprland_extra), so the conjunction could never fire; pattern-extends,
  Requires and pattern-visible are untouched, so selecting hyprland_extra still
  pulls hyprland.
- Reword the hyprland_extra Summary and description from add-ons to extras.
- Add a no-binary rpmlintrc filter at error level, shipped as a new Source0
  file.
- Format with spec-cleaner 1.3.1: drop the Group tags, fix the copyright header,
  add SECTION labels, remove the duplicated licence header block, and fold near-
  duplicate SECTION headers into their markers.

